{"chunk_id": "1926bcac638e", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "无标题", "date_hint": "", "text": "光刻机八大唯一介绍\n本题材汇总光刻机领域具备技术领先优势的国内A股企业。\n光刻机基本面介绍\n光刻机(MaskAligner)是通过光学原理将集成电路图案转移到硅片表面的核心设备，其工作流程包括涂胶、曝光、显影、刻蚀等步骤。核心原理是利用特定波长的光源(从紫外光到极紫外光)通过掩模版将电路图案投影到涂覆光刻胶的硅片上，经化学反应形成纳米级电路结构。一台先进光刻机包含10万+零部件，需整合光学、机械、电子、材料等多学科尖端技术，其精度要求达到头发丝直径的三万分之一。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "1926bcac638e", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "c94fd667b6f3", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "应用领域", "date_hint": "", "text": "半导体芯片制造:逻辑芯片(CPU/GPU)、存储芯片(NAND/DRAM)的核心制程设备先进封装:2.5D/3D封装中的硅中介层(Interposer)制造微机电系统(MEMS):传感器、执行器等精密器件生产\n显示面板:LCD/OLED的TFT阵列制造\n功率器件:IGBT、MOSFET等车规级半导体器件", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "c94fd667b6f3", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "b924b35b5562", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "产业地位", "date_hint": "", "text": "全球仅有3家企业能生产高端光刻机(ASML/尼康/佳能)，其占芯片制造成本的35%，耗时占整个生产流程的40%-60%制程，EUV光刻机是7nm以下制程的唯一解决方案战略价值:被称为\"半导体产业的光刻机\"，其技术垄断直接影响国家科技竞争力。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "b924b35b5562", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "78b10c4ee779", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "竞争格局", "date_hint": "", "text": "全球光刻机市场由 ASML(荷兰)、尼康(日本)、佳能(日本)主导，2024年合计份额超95%\nASML：市占率61.2%，EUV光刻机全球唯一供应商，单台售价超1.9亿欧元，2024年出货44台，用于3nm及以下芯片，DUV领域占92%份额。ArFi浸没式光刻机(193nm等效134nm)支持7nm工艺，年销量129台。\n尼康：主攻ArFi和KrF光刻机(248nm)，在面板光刻设备市占率35%。\n佳能：聚焦i-line(365nm)和封装光刻机，全球封装市场占60%", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "78b10c4ee779", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
{"chunk_id": "b8a512e36903", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "国内光刻机：上海微电子", "date_hint": "", "text": "上海微电子装备（集团）股份有限公司（SMEE）成立于2002年，总部位于上海张江，是中国​​唯一具备光刻机整机研发与量产能力​​的企业，业务覆盖集成电路前道、先进封装、面板显示（FPD）、MEMS、LED等领域。其国有控股（上海电气集团为大股东），获国家“02专项”重点支持，2024年估值超6000亿元。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "b8a512e36903", "label": "candidate_mixed", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "dropped_to_noise", "used_fallback": true, "judge_decision": "drop", "judge_confidence": 0.5, "judge_reason": "fallback: missing from judge response"}
